<title>UK: British Biotech slips after placing.</title>
<headline>British Biotech slips after placing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Biotech Plc fell on Tuesday after Morgan Stanley placed 21.1 million shares in the biotechnology company.</p>
<p>The shares were placed on behalf of an institutional seller at 213p per share among a number of UK and overseas houses, market sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;It went very well indeed. There was very good demand,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>The shares ended 22-1/2p lower at 218p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
